  "body": "Large, complex rooms with many servers can take many minutes to join over federation. This is a known issue (#1211).\r\n\r\nOne possible option for addressing this is described in [MSC2775: Lazy loading over federation](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2775).\r\n\r\nWe should prototype it in Synapse to determine its viability.",
